sequenceDiagram
    participant API as NestJS request
    participant DB as Tenant database
    participant Outbox as Durable intent/outbox
    participant Redis as Redis and BullMQ
    participant Worker as Tenant-stamped worker
    participant Audit as Job evidence

    API->>DB: Commit business state and durable intent
    DB-->>API: Transaction committed
    API->>Redis: Enqueue bounded job envelope
    Redis-->>API: Job id
    Redis->>Worker: Deliver job
    Worker->>Worker: Reconstruct trusted tenant context
    Worker->>DB: Process idempotently
    DB-->>Worker: Success, duplicate, or domain failure
    Worker->>Audit: Persist attempt/result metadata
    Worker-->>Redis: Ack or retry with backoff
    Redis-->>Worker: Dead-letter after retry policy
    Worker->>Audit: Record terminal failure and remediation key
